{"lines":[{"y":0.035833946796833382,"c":1,"w":0.23175732930501303,"t":"Sample Writing answers","h":0.021007266891336918,"x":0.67925091512248092},{"y":0.082965628867493146,"x":0.075450577171743832,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","w":0.36184346516927079,"h":0.02883472145532151,"c":1},{"x":0.075728153503618223,"c":1,"t":"This model has been prepared by an examiner as an example of a very good answer.","y":0.12492211847463031,"w":0.80582524617513029,"h":0.016199376947040434},{"y":0.15261627853937043,"c":1,"w":0.7417475891113281,"h":0.020348838259497959,"x":0.075728147063470322,"t":"Students attend university to improve their prospects and find suitable employment after"},{"h":0.023683221169349844,"y":0.1725646802621732,"w":0.83121047973632811,"c":1,"t":"graduation. For this reason, some feel that they should focus all their energy on their main subjects","x":0.07565011059224655},{"w":0.80592885335286457,"c":1,"h":0.021018972426560034,"x":0.075672697584463253,"y":0.19562343528781967,"t":"to gain a relevant qualification. Others want a more well-rounded education, so they try to learn"},{"c":1,"x":0.075728154849863616,"t":"about additional subjects.","y":0.21802325607879913,"w":0.2155339813232422,"h":0.019048394889475073},{"x":0.075728150825326287,"w":0.7864077758789062,"c":1,"t":"It is perfectly reasonable for students to enter university with a strong sense of curiosity and a","h":0.02040136224384248,"y":0.2470404987430137},{"x":0.075728156965245055,"y":0.26884735204990928,"h":0.020396834519050611,"c":1,"w":0.79417475382486968,"t":"desire to learn as much as possible. Unfortunately, we tend to put subjects into artificial boxes,"},{"c":1,"y":0.29065420535561559,"h":0.02039230679425863,"t":"suggesting that business, art and science are not connected. If students become too focused on a","x":0.075728143898785252,"w":0.80970876057942709},{"t":"single area, it may stifle their initial curiosity, limiting their potential. They could also graduate with","y":0.31246105904812704,"h":0.021841266667731452,"c":1,"x":0.075728148346913146,"w":0.82330098470052082},{"c":1,"y":0.33271027998197855,"t":"a very narrow skill set that doesn't translate well to the current job market, which often favours","x":0.075728147378959915,"w":0.79805826822916659,"h":0.020560747663551426},{"h":0.019003115264797366,"t":"those who have taken a multidisciplinary approach to their studies.","x":0.075728167335737215,"y":0.35607476607528676,"w":0.55922327677408867,"c":1},{"y":0.385046728719312,"h":0.019023038442261053,"c":1,"x":0.075728153569164555,"w":0.80582524617513018,"t":"Despite this, caution is certainly needed. The more we learn about a subject, the more complex it"},{"t":"becomes. Gaining an in-depth, specialist knowledge of a subject requires a certain level of focus","c":1,"w":0.80582524617513018,"x":0.075728153544822208,"y":0.40685358241278835,"h":0.020560747663551426},{"y":0.42866043571999612,"x":0.075728164131092512,"w":0.82718444824218751,"t":"and dedication over a long period. If we try to learn about too many things at once, our knowledge","h":0.020560747663551426,"c":1},{"x":0.075728145600689536,"y":0.44912790644773315,"c":1,"t":"may lack the depth required to obtain a qualification. If they are not careful, young people could","w":0.80388351440429684,"h":0.020348838259497848},{"h":0.022567933222215064,"c":1,"w":0.74186452229817712,"x":0.075660720337772699,"t":"begin to lose interest in their main subjects, which would be detrimental to their studies.","y":0.47025396128860208},{"w":0.78458913167317723,"t":"While learning about other subjects is not necessarily a bad thing, I believe university students","h":0.021441236834659816,"y":0.5006594041850716,"c":1,"x":0.075675128292990529},{"t":"should ensure that their main subjects remain the priority so that they do not lose sight of their","h":0.0188953482844747,"c":1,"w":0.80194173177083328,"x":0.075728163144480054,"y":0.52325581422735634},{"y":0.54033276240375272,"w":0.79646947224934883,"h":0.028864264562493913,"c":1,"t":"oojective: gaining a qualification. Then they can calculate how much time, energy and headspace","x":0.075565500638459085},{"w":0.38640777587890623,"c":1,"t":"they have left for learning about other topics.","h":0.018895348284474811,"x":0.075728150768834671,"y":0.56686046538638957},{"x":0.077669907258921186,"w":0.41359222412109375,"c":1,"y":0.60311526478024513,"t":"Here are comments from another examiner:","h":0.014641744548286595},{"w":0.77475728352864592,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1,"y":0.63364485979718932,"x":0.12233009599964124,"t":"This response addresses both parts of the task and presents a clear opinion at the"},{"h":0.0188953482844747,"w":0.75145629882812504,"t":"end. The second paragraph explains how the current university system is set up","c":1,"y":0.64970930259351323,"x":0.12233010296024399},{"t":"to [put subjects into artificial boxes] and how this narrow focus can disadvantage","y":0.66809098981475978,"h":0.019456774274879574,"x":0.12034053151525503,"w":0.75738423665364585,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12233008959680394,"y":0.68895348825875091,"t":"students. The third paragraph presents the benefits of [Gaining an in-depth,","w":0.71067962646484384,"h":0.017588567882312112},{"t":"specialist knowledge] and the dangers of trying to include too much. Both sides of","c":1,"x":0.12225135137170771,"w":0.76910380045572913,"h":0.020770456189307063,"y":0.70520146395412464},{"y":0.72674418614030101,"c":1,"w":0.54951456705729163,"x":0.12233009501111715,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"the question are addressed in well-developed paragraphs."},{"t":"To improve the response, it would be helpful to set out the opinion at the start, for","h":0.018895348284474811,"c":1,"y":0.75726744213435915,"w":0.76310679117838531,"x":0.12233009945706347},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"t":"added continuity of the position.","c":1,"x":0.12233009611945027,"y":0.77601246081817532,"w":0.30291262308756511},{"c":1,"t":"Vocabulary is natural and sophisticated [stifle their initial curiosity | Gaining an","w":0.73009709676106771,"x":0.12233009229877903,"y":0.80654205583717076,"h":0.017585851247436945},{"c":1,"x":0.1203883533488774,"t":"in-depth, specialist knowledge | detrimental to their studies] without errors.","h":0.019003115264797477,"y":0.8255451714469616,"w":0.70097086588541668},{"w":0.75158798217773437,"h":0.020595416250258625,"t":"Grammatical structures are wide-ranging, with a range of tenses and conditional","x":0.12421432420603992,"y":0.85548254054995276,"c":1},{"w":0.70496058146158858,"h":0.018920420709057417,"t":"[if] and modal [may | could | would | can] structures embedded in complex,","c":1,"x":0.1203379789912601,"y":0.87500003567043405},{"w":0.18130827585856119,"c":1,"t":"flexible sentences.","y":0.89334662078191684,"x":0.12007599176837568,"h":0.018156800314644728},{"w":0.56504852294921881,"t":"This is a high-level response which fully addresses the task.","x":0.12233010735932372,"y":0.9258566976645175,"h":0.016003767352237852,"c":1},{"w":0.034951454798380577,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.87184466085894785,"t":"131","y":0.95494186072637066}],"w":2400,"h":3209}